      "width": 786.45,
      "height": 52.5,
      "text": "Solid arrow: project reference (depends on). Dashed: runtime traffic or I/O.\nInfrastructure and Persistence implement the ports Application declares; Domain depends on nothing of ours.\nThe engine comes from configuration (Database:Provider); LayerDependencyTests enforces the references.",
      "originalText": "Solid arrow: project reference (depends on). Dashed: runtime traffic or I/O.\nInfrastructure and Persistence implement the ports Application declares; Domain depends on nothing of ours.\nThe engine comes from configuration (Database:Provider); LayerDependencyTests enforces the references.",
